  <description>灾荒和饥饿，在这残酷冰冷的边缘世界，体面活着成为一种奢望。添加了一些事件、特质、角色经历、背景故事，适用于鼠族世界观，推荐和军阀、游击队等世界观扩展模组搭配使用。

Famine and hunger. On this cold, cruel rimworld, living with dignity has become a luxury. Adds incidents, traits, personal histories, and backstories for the Ratkin setting. Recommended alongside lore expansions such as Warlords and Guerrillas.</description>
